    "chunks": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "documentId": "DOC-CNC-COOLING-001",
        "version": 1,
        "strategy": "STRUCTURE",
        "chunkId": "3b1501c0-6a99-535a-a787-991f877024c8",
        "chunkIndex": 0,
        "content": "数控机床出现主轴过热报警时，应先检查冷却液液位与冷却泵运行声音，再检查散热器滤网是否堵塞；冷却液液位低于下刻线时必须停机补充同型号冷却液。",
        "chunkContentHash": "bf8b700e79265a630edb1c2fa685f0b0adf04c423753c0ad9a4dce74cec4f490",
        "charLength": 69,
        "globalStart": 0,
        "globalEnd": 69,
        "status": "INDEXED",
        "vectorSpaceId": "bailian|qwen3.7-text-embedding|remote-v1|1024",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:24",
        "updatedAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:24"
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "documentId": "DOC-CNC-COOLING-001",
        "version": 1,
        "strategy": "STRUCTURE",
        "chunkId": "fe30f5f7-1844-5a71-b436-2d64a5bd3b76",
        "chunkIndex": 1,
        "content": "若冷却液充足但仍反复过热报警，应使用万用表测量主轴温度传感器阻值；阻值跳变或与常温对照值偏差超过20%时判定温度传感器老化，需要更换并重新校准。",
        "chunkContentHash": "74f239999cc55e835d6e64089d6a0b94d41ed2f589459b71c2f7c0d04a9b58b4",
        "charLength": 72,
        "globalStart": 69,
        "globalEnd": 141,
        "status": "INDEXED",
        "vectorSpaceId": "bailian|qwen3.7-text-embedding|remote-v1|1024",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:24",
        "updatedAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:24"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "documentId": "DOC-CNC-COOLING-001",
        "version": 1,
        "strategy": "STRUCTURE",
        "chunkId": "bc123920-e5d8-51f3-886d-7945ff6b3e00",
        "chunkIndex": 2,
        "content": "冷却泵异响伴随流量下降时，优先检查吸入口滤网与管路气塞；排气后流量仍不足需更换泵体密封件，禁止在系统带压状态下拆卸管路。",
        "chunkContentHash": "8066c4246dec333ba751da6322cd14385d5b157341cf69b8210396845acee2be",
        "charLength": 60,
        "globalStart": 141,
        "globalEnd": 201,
        "status": "INDEXED",
        "vectorSpaceId": "bailian|qwen3.7-text-embedding|remote-v1|1024",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:24",
        "updatedAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:24"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "documentId": "DOC-SERVO-TROUBLE-002",
    "status": [
      {
