    "chunks": [
      {
        "id": 7,
        "documentId": "DOC-WORKORDER-SPEC-003",
        "version": 1,
        "strategy": "STRUCTURE",
        "chunkId": "ea060e98-c367-5994-bcf7-b5b83bdf1b86",
        "chunkIndex": 0,
        "content": "导致整条产线停机的设备故障定为一级工单，要求15分钟内响应、2小时内给出临时处置方案；单机可绕行的故障定为二级工单，响应时限为2小时。",
        "chunkContentHash": "eb75f6e6fe6fe8fbde524f4816771c36bc671f0af38c9028898ab7580b279020",
        "charLength": 67,
        "globalStart": 0,
        "globalEnd": 67,
        "status": "INDEXED",
        "vectorSpaceId": "bailian|qwen3.7-text-embedding|remote-v1|1024",
        "createdAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:25",
        "updatedAt": "2026-11-21T16:58:25"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "documentId": "DOC-WORKORDER-SPEC-003",
        "version": 1,
        "strategy": "STRUCTURE",
        "chunkId": "a229290f-7ae2-5e5f-bd40-cba9e20bceb1",
        "chunkIndex": 1,
        "content": "工单关闭必须填写故障根因、更换备件编号与复测数据三项内容；仅有处理经过但缺少复测数据的工单不得关单，由值班主管退回补充。",
        "chunkContentHash": "a4e5b344eaf01817acf512ad2ea28900fb3d29673005a71ffc3a81512ba593df",
        "charLength": 60,
        "globalStart": 67,
        "globalEnd": 127,
